msgid "`GenomeInitializer`"
msgstr "`GenomeInitializer`"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md
msgid "Generate Genomes with `Problem.space.sample()`"
msgstr "`Problem.space.sample()` によるGenome生成"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md
msgid "`LHSInitializer`"
msgstr "`LHSInitializer`"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md
