#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md
msgid "`scipy.stats.qmc.Sobol(scramble=True)`"
msgstr "`scipy.stats.qmc.Sobol(scramble=True)`"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:30
msgid ""
"`GenomeInitializer` registers the Genomes provided by SearchSpace "
"directly in the Archive. The other three share the constructor "
"`(n_init_archive, n_init_population, seed=None)` and generate initial "
"points in vector form. All four evaluate the initial Archive, sort it "
"with the Comparator, and pass the top candidates to the initial "
"Population."
msgstr ""
"`GenomeInitializer` は、SearchSpaceが提供するGenomeをそのままArchiveへ登録します。 "
"他の3つは同じコンストラクタ `(n_init_archive, n_init_population, seed=None)` "
"を持ち、ベクトル表現の初期点を生成します。 "
"いずれも初期Archiveを評価し、Comparatorで並べた上位候補を初期Populationへ渡します。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:42
msgid ""
"The three classes' implementations are nearly identical except for the "
"one line doing the sampling — this is a deliberate choice for simplicity,"
" a design that doesn't over-abstract the shared processing."
msgstr "3クラスの実装はサンプリング方法の1行以外ほぼ重複していますが、これは意図的な単純さの選択であり、共通処理を過度に抽象化しない設計になっています。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:44
msgid "Base-class helper methods"
msgstr "基底クラスのヘルパーメソッド"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:46
msgid ""
"The `Initializer` base provides two helper methods reusable in custom "
"implementations."
msgstr "`Initializer`基底には、独自実装で再利用できる2つのヘルパーメソッドが用意されています。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:48
msgid ""
"**`_create_attrs(problem, provider)`**: Builds the `PopulationAttribute` "
"values for `Population` and `Archive`. The legacy vector path uses `x`, "
"`f`, `g`, and `cv`, and adds auxiliary attributes required by the "
"Algorithm. `GenomeInitializer` manages Genomes in a dedicated column, so "
"its standard attributes do not include `x`."
msgstr ""
"**`_create_attrs(problem, provider)`**：`Population` と `Archive` の "
"`PopulationAttribute` を組み立てます。 旧来のベクトル経路では `x`、`f`、`g`、`cv` "
"を使い、Algorithmが必要とする補助属性を追加します。 `GenomeInitializer` "
"ではGenomeが専用の列として管理されるため、標準属性に `x` を含めません。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:52
msgid ""
"**`_create_context(problem, archive, pareto_archive, population, rng)`**:"
" Builds the `OptimizationState`. When the Comparator is an "
"`NSGA3Comparator` without an internal random generator, this sets "
"`rng.spawn(1)[0]`."
msgstr ""
"**`_create_context(problem, archive, pareto_archive, population, "
"rng)`**：`OptimizationState` を構築します。 Comparatorが `NSGA3Comparator` "
"で内部乱数生成器をまだ持たない場合は、ここで `rng.spawn(1)[0]` を設定します。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:55
msgid "Implementing a custom Initializer"
msgstr "独自Initializerの実装方法"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:57
msgid ""
"To add custom vector sampling, subclass `Initializer` and implement "
"`initialize()`. For a new Genome representation, implement an Initializer"
" that uses `Problem.space.sample()` and `Problem.space.validate()`."
msgstr ""
"独自のベクトルサンプリングを追加する場合は `Initializer` を継承して `initialize()` を実装します。 "
"新しいGenome表現を使う場合は、`Problem.space.sample()` と `Problem.space.validate()` "
"を使うInitializerを実装します。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:60
msgid "Genome-native initialization keeps the following order."
msgstr "Genome-nativeな初期化では、次の順序を保ちます。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:62
msgid ""
"Create containers with the Algorithm's `population_class`, "
"`archive_class`, and `create_pareto_archive()`."
msgstr ""
"Algorithmの `population_class`、`archive_class`、`create_pareto_archive()` "
"で入れ物を作る。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:63
msgid "Build the `OptimizationState`."
msgstr "`OptimizationState` を構築する。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:64
msgid ""
"Generate Genomes with `problem.space.sample(n, rng)` and validate them "
"with `problem.space.validate()`."
msgstr ""
"`problem.space.sample(n, rng)` でGenomeを生成し、`problem.space.validate()` "
"で検証する。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:65
msgid "Evaluate them with `provider.evaluator.evaluate_batch(genomes, problem)`."
msgstr "`provider.evaluator.evaluate_batch(genomes, problem)` で評価する。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:66
msgid ""
"Register candidate IDs, Genomes, and evaluation results in the Archive "
"and ParetoArchive."
msgstr "候補ID、Genome、評価結果をArchiveとParetoArchiveへ登録する。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:67
msgid ""
"Update the evaluation count and pass Comparator-sorted candidates to the "
"Population."
msgstr "評価回数を更新し、Comparatorで並べた候補をPopulationへ渡す。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:69
msgid ""
"The following skeleton shows the input and output boundary used by a "
"Genome-native Initializer."
msgstr "次の骨格は、Genome-nativeなInitializerが使う入力と出力の境界を示しています。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:82
msgid ""
"The start and end of the initial evaluation can be observed through "
"`CallbackManager`. Because the evaluation Request must preserve candidate"
" IDs and Genomes, do not manage Genomes by implicitly converting them to "
"an `x` array."
msgstr ""
"初期評価の開始と終了は `CallbackManager` から観測できます。 "
"評価Requestの候補IDとGenomeを維持する必要があるため、Genomeを `x` 配列へ暗黙に変換して管理しません。"

#: ../../concepts/execution_and_evaluation/initialization.md:85
msgid "Swap the Initializer with `Optimizer.set_initializer(initializer)`."
msgstr "`Optimizer.set_initializer(initializer)` でInitializerを差し替えます。"

